<section class="trust" id="trust">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">Keamanan</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Data kamu <span class="gradient-text">aman di tangan kamu</span></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Kami serius soal privasi dan keamanan data finansialmu.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-grid">
      <div class="trust-card">
        <div class="trust-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="trust-title">Enkripsi Berlapis</h3>
        <p class="trust-desc">Data dilindungi Row Level Security — hanya kamu yang bisa akses data milikmu sendiri.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-card">
        <div class="trust-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="trust-title">Tidak Dijual ke Pihak Ketiga</h3>
        <p class="trust-desc">Data finansialmu bukan produk. Tidak dibagikan, tidak dijual, tidak dipakai untuk iklan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-card">
        <div class="trust-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="trust-title">Export Kapan Saja</h3>
        <p class="trust-desc">Data kamu milik kamu. Download semua transaksi dan laporan kapanpun kamu mau.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-card">
        <div class="trust-icon-wrap">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><line x1="23" x2="17" y1="11" y2="11"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="trust-title">Tim Pun Tidak Bisa Akses</h3>
        <p class="trust-desc">Bahkan tim Aidah tidak bisa melihat data keuanganmu. Privasimu adalah prioritas utama.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .trust{padding:80px 0;background:var(--bg)}
  .trust-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px}
  .trust-card{background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px 24px;transition:var(--transition);box-shadow:var(--shadow-bold);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
  .trust-card:hover{transform:translate(-2px,-2px);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--ink)}
  .trust-icon-wrap{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--blue-100);border:2px solid var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:2px 2px 0 var(--ink);color:var(--blue-600)}
  .trust-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:900;color:var(--text)}
  .trust-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-weight:600}
  @media(max-width:768px){.trust-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
